 round counts. You'll need to find everything you can to help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/793dd542da963e211adbb208d27622c3.poster.avif?t=1785910648\" width=614 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/793dd542da963e211adbb208d27622c3.webm?t=1785910648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/793dd542da963e211adbb208d27622c3.mp4?t=1785910648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve: </strong>Surreal puzzles and obstacles await. You won't overcome this trial through sheer force alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/fbdf48372a25b3a8d70ad1e2dbb7082c.poster.avif?t=1785910648\" width=614 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/fbdf48372a25b3a8d70ad1e2dbb7082c.webm?t=1785910648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736910/extras/fbdf48372a25b3a8d70ad1e2dbb7082c.mp4?t=1785910648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek:</strong> Traverse a city where reality has been unraveled and your actions are observed. Your decisions directly change the world and determine how the story ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as